  "info":{"title":"ANSTAY Integration Gateway","version":"1.6.0","description":"Server-to-server contract for ANSTAY website and OTA adapters. Published rates, availability, reservation sync, idempotent inbound webhooks, durable outbound dispatch and OTA payout ingestion are separated from operational UI data."},
